    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/d74416fd51afd47e4b7f7151639fa799.avif?t=1754418878\" /></div><br><br>Synthrun is an action-platformer where you take control of &quot;Jake&quot;, a boy trapped in an abstract world.<br>The goal is to collect the energy orbs at the end of each level.<br>Can you collect all 50 and help Jake escape?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>- Race through an abstract track with pumping music in the background.<br><br>- Use 4 cool powers to help you through.<br>- There are over 50 unique levels to complete!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Features</h2>- Steam Achievements, the game has <strong>10 achievements</strong>. <br>- Steam Leaderboards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/79b2f516394eeb8dfc115937e3ab9ef4.poster.avif?t=1754418878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/79b2f516394eeb8dfc115937e3ab9ef4.webm?t=1754418878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/79b2f516394eeb8dfc115937e3ab9ef4.mp4?t=1754418878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/d74416fd51afd47e4b7f7151639fa799.avif?t=1754418878\" /></div><br><br>Synthrun is an action-platformer where you take control of &quot;Jake&quot;, a boy trapped in an abstract world.<br>The goal is to collect the energy orbs at the end of each level.<br>Can you collect all 50 and help Jake escape?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>- Race through an abstract track with pumping music in the background.<br><br>- Use 4 cool powers to help you through.<br>- There are over 50 unique levels to complete!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steam Features</h2>- Steam Achievements, the game has <strong>10 achievements</strong>. <br>- Steam Leaderboards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/79b2f516394eeb8dfc115937e3ab9ef4.poster.avif?t=1754418878\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/79b2f516394eeb8dfc115937e3ab9ef4.webm?t=1754418878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/893120/extras/79b2f516394eeb8dfc115937e3ab9ef4.mp4?t=1754418878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
